OL,3,GNEWSADad regaining movement after
OL,4,Abreaking neck
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was told he would never feel
OL,7,Fanything from the neck down again after
OL,8,Fan accident on holiday is regaining
OL,9,Ffeeling and movement in his lower body.
OL,11,FDavid Hayes, from Torquay, Devon, was
OL,12,Fleft with catastrophic injuries when he
OL,13,Fbroke his neck while diving in the sea
OL,14,Fwith his children in Ibiza.
OL,16,FHe said: "I was playing with the kids,
OL,17,Fdiving into the sea off the rock. I
OL,18,Fdived off for the fourth time and I
OL,19,Fjust heard a crunch... I went numb.
OL,20,FInstantly everywhere I couldn't move. I
OL,21,Fknew something was really, really bad."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
