OL,3,GNEWSADad regaining movement after
OL,4,Abreaking neck
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifteen months on from the accident,
OL,7,FDavid is now able to move both of his
OL,8,Farms and has some mobility in his core
OL,9,F- and he has high hopes for the future.
